# Screenshots keep their names when they are re-taken, so a browser that kept one for four hours went on showing the
# old look after a deploy. They revalidate on every visit instead; the ETag makes that a 304 when unchanged.
# The tablewalk.dev zone's Browser Cache TTL (4 hours) overrides a shorter origin header, so the links also carry a
# version (?v=N in Hero.astro and the docs): bump it when the shots are re-taken.
/shots/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
